  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "1ws6OOXQruVXqiv3RlZn+Al1hhw=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-20T10:34:17.546Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Manufacturing is recorded as sufficiently decentralized with standardization \u2014 \"many factories are SMEs\", with \"standardised procurement and delivery: PPEP\" \u2014 able to help establish PMF, holding companion software in UMH and Paperless, \"well connected\", and possessing an established consultancy market evidenced by the Industry Dynamics proposal to NIKO.\n\nEvery other industry assessed carries at least one miss or question mark. Manufacturing carries none, and it is also the industry whose companion software (Paperless) the session then took forward into a worked demo scenario.\n\nThat coherence \u2014 criteria satisfied, relationships in place, a named consultancy engagement, and a demo already storyboarded \u2014 is what makes it the default first target rather than one option among several.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-20T10:34:17.546834Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-20T10:34:17.546839Z"
    }
  },
